{"id": "e7e8e6b4e412f5136464785499c36ab632a8da35de98ac06b9ee21eabf5dbf38", "original": "이것이... 아수라의 정체..", "contains_korean": true, "chinese_reference": "这就是……阿修罗的真面目……", "object_name": "art_ko_fl04_s07", "reference": {"file": "ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle", "serialized_file": "CAB-c86448dee009bfdefa236923310b57ad", "object_id": 3713336604749090944, "path": ["TextList", 0, "Text"]}, "patch_json_path": ["files", 8, "changes", 245, "ops", 0, "value"], "target": "So this... is Asura's true form...", "status": "draft", "translation_basis": "original Korean", "notes": ["Korean checked alongside Chinese; Asura provisional spelling follows equipment catalog."]}
